If necessary, Please include here any comments \par
about why the paper should be accepted or rejected.\par
\par
\par
The technical depth of this paper is not as good as many other
papers I read recently. This paper basically just confirms that 
multimodality searches could help improve visual search accuracy, which 
is nothing new.   However, if the authors wish to rework their paper and 
provide more helpful data and details, you might want to reconsider it.
